Alteration {G}{W}{U}
Wizards in your hand have Alteration {G}{W}{U}
Whenever you cast Nymphadora Lupin or a Wizard from the battlefield, that creature enters with a vigilance counter and it deals damage equal to its power to any target. Then put two +1/+1 counters on it.

Equipped creature gets +1/+0.
Equipped creature has “Whenever an player draws a card, except during their draw step, that player exiles the top card of their library unless they pay {2}. You may cast cards exiled this way for as long as it remains exiled, and mana of any type can be spent to cast those spells.”
Equip {2}
